{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"耶利米書","commonName":"耶利米書","title":"耶利米書","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"681b5a173916e28ae5f3b5c6bb5d16263b7d167f21a486ef3c62ed1ab29150f3","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1352},"chapter":{"number":10,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["上帝與偶像"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["以色列家啊，聽聽耶和華對你們說的話吧！"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["耶和華說：",{"text":"「不要效法列國的行為。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們被天象嚇倒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們卻不要因天象而害怕。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們信奉的毫無價值，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們從林中砍一棵樹，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"工匠用鑿子雕刻偶像，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以金銀作裝飾，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用釘子和錘子釘牢，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以免晃動。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它們像瓜園中的稻草人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不能說話，不能行走，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"需要人搬運。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們不要怕它們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它們既不能害人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不能助人。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"耶和華啊，你無與倫比，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你真偉大，你的名充滿力量！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"萬國的王啊，誰不敬畏你？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"敬畏你是理所當然的。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為萬國的智者和君王中無人能與你相比。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們都愚昧無知，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"竟從無用的木頭偶像受教！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"偶像上的銀片來自他施，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"金片來自烏法，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都是木匠和金匠的作品，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這些偶像穿的藍色和紫色衣服都是巧匠製作的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"唯有耶和華是真神，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是永活的上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是永恆的君王。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂一發怒，大地便震動，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"列國都無法承受祂的烈怒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["你們要這樣對他們說：「那些神明沒有創造天地，它們將從天地間消亡。」"]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"耶和華以大能創造大地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以智慧建立世界，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以聰明鋪展諸天。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂一聲令下，天上便大水澎湃；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂使雲從地極升起，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使閃電在雨中劃過，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使風從祂的倉庫吹出。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"世人都愚昧無知，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"金匠都因所造的偶像而羞愧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為神像是騙人的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它們沒有生命氣息。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它們毫無價值，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"荒唐可笑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"刑罰一到，必被毀滅。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但雅各的上帝截然不同，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為祂是萬物的創造者，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列子民是祂的產業，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"萬軍之耶和華是祂的名字。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被圍困的居民啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"收拾行裝離開吧！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「看啊，這次我要把這地方的居民拋出去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他們苦不堪言方肯覺悟。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"text":"我有禍了！因我的創傷難癒。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我說：「這是疾病，我必須忍受。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的帳篷已毀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"繩索已斷；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的兒女都離我而去，蹤影全無，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"再沒有人為我支搭帳篷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"掛上幔子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"首領愚昧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沒有求問耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此一敗塗地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"百姓如羊群四散。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"text":"聽啊，有消息傳來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"喧囂的敵軍從北方衝來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要使猶大的城邑荒涼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"淪為豺狼的巢穴。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"text":"耶和華啊，我知道人不能駕馭自己的命運，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不能左右自己的前程。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，求你公正地懲罰我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要帶著怒氣懲罰我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"免得你使我不復存在。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你向不認識你的列國和不求告你名的民族發烈怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們吞噬、毀滅雅各，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他的家園一片荒涼。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/10.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/11.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/9.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":25}